cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "ABI AI CoP Shared Prompt Library for Bioinformatics"
message: "If you use this library, please cite it using these metadata."
type: dataset
abstract: >-
  A community-authored, peer-reviewed collection of tested prompts for
  LLM-assisted bioinformatics workflows, developed by the African
  Bioinformatics Institute Community of Practice on AI for Bioinformatics,
  with emphasis on African biological data, documented model failure modes,
  and version-stamped re-validation.
